00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:40,080
of features that we'd never imagined. So we've opened up Burp's AI ecosystem to the Montoya API.

157
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:46,160
This makes it really easy to invoke AI operations from your code. You don't need to write any boilerplate.

158
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:50,960
You don't need to handle API keys. You don't need to create UI to configure anything. It just works.

159
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:56,640
And for users, they can have trust that all the data is being handled securely. Everything goes

160
00:17:56,640 --> 00:18:04,400
through our secure AI gateway. They just need to configure AI in one place. So if you have an idea

161
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:10,720
for using AI to add cool new features in Burp, definitely go for it. The Portswigger research team

162
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:16,480
have already been doing this. Gareth Hayes has added AI capabilities to supercharge

163
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:23,440
his HackVerser extension and he's added an AI assistant to Burp Repeater. Those are available

