00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:53,280
once you see the value, once you see the benefits. Now, we do expect that attitudes to data handling

183
00:20:53,280 --> 00:21:00,320
and AI will evolve in the same way that attitudes to cloud and SaaS evolved a generation ago.

184
00:21:01,840 --> 00:21:06,720
People will gain confidence that data is being handled properly when the right protections are in place.

185
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:15,200
And when people see the value that AI adds, that will start to outweigh the concerns about data

