00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:56,160
your adversaries an unfair advantage. So just to wrap things up before going on to your questions.

191
00:21:57,280 --> 00:22:04,000
AI is exciting. It's going to change everything, including AppSec. We really are at the start of a

192
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:12,720
new chapter, the pen testing. AI has got the potential to supercharge your work, take care of the boring

